{"version":1,"content":"<p>諾華（Novartis）行政總裁、Anthropic董事會成員瓦斯·納拉辛漢（Vas Narasimhan）駁斥了人工智能將在未來五至十年內攻克癌症的觀點。他認為，即使經過十年發展，人工智能也只能將藥物研發周期縮短四年。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587596.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.796595+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:08:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.380482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.380482+00:00","content_hash":"53e9cc78c897f0e3d7ebdcff5f064a4c4688b8a5a6102f2863abe20b3be67222","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}